00:00:00,749 --> 00:00:02,300
All right, Team Rocket again here

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,000
with project number two, task board.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,300
So, here, the problem

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,800
that we were trying to solve is that

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,800
with many projects, there remains to be

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,200
open-ended tasks without fixed deadlines,

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,300
which get frequently neglected.

8
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,800
This task board integrates task weighting

9
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:20,200
directly into a visual progress bar,

10
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,500
which you will see on the output screen.

11
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:34,600
Okay, and so, yeah,

12
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,700
as you can see here, we have a progress

13
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:38,700
bar at the top.

14
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,700
We have the Kanban board over here,

15
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:43,000
and as we move items into In Progress,

16
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
you can see that it's starting

17
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,800
to progress the board.

18
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,600
And then when we move items to Done,

19
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,800
then you start seeing a new board get --

20
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:59,000
